                <div id="257573671-content" class="article-section-wrapper js-article-section js-content-section  " data-section-parent-id="257573669">
                    
                    <ul class="list-simple"><li><p>Experimental procedures;
sample characterization; <em>in situ</em> Raman spectra and
control measurements; interfacial-water
spectral analysis; computational methods and analyses of cation hydration,
pore access, charge redistribution, electric fields, and vibrational
properties (<a class="supplementary-material-link" reveal-id="all-supplement-materials-popup" data-open="all-supplement-materials-popup" href="/jacsat/article-supplement/5429482/docx/ja6c10062_si_001/" path-from-xml="sifile1">DOCX</a>)</p></li></ul>
